{
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 1.0,
   "end": 6.515,
   "file": "jane_00_s1.wav",
   "text": "In December 1952, two young Americans were reported lost on a flight from Korea to Japan.",
   "mos": 4.514
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 7.5,
   "end": 8.748,
   "file": "jane_01_s1.wav",
   "text": "That was a cover story.",
   "mos": 4.369
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 9.7,
   "end": 14.276,
   "file": "jane_02_s1.wav",
   "text": "John Downey and Richard Fecteau were CIA officers, shot down inside China.",
   "mos": 4.49
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 15.2,
   "end": 19.04,
   "file": "jane_03_s3.wav",
   "text": "Their job that night: pick up an agent from the snow, without landing.",
   "mos": 4.493
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 20.3,
   "end": 25.57,
   "file": "jane_04_s2.wav",
   "text": "Two poles held a line. The plane trails a hook, catches the line, and winches the man aboard.",
   "mos": 4.524
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 26.7,
   "end": 30.508,
   "file": "jane_05_s2.wav",
   "text": "But the agent team had been caught. The radio call was a trap.",
   "mos": 4.509
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 31.8,
   "end": 38.232,
   "file": "jane_06_s2.wav",
   "text": "Under a nearly full moon, the plane came in low and slow. White sheets flew off two hidden guns.",
   "mos": 4.511
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 39.8,
   "end": 45.24,
   "file": "jane_07_s3.wav",
   "text": "The plane crashed in the trees. Both pilots died. Downey and Fecteau lived.",
   "mos": 4.504
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 46.7,
   "end": 50.69,
   "file": "jane_08_s2.wav",
   "text": "A Chinese officer looked at Downey and said: You are Jack.",
   "mos": 4.529
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 51.5,
   "end": 54.327,
   "file": "jane_09_s3.wav",
   "text": "For twenty years, Washington stuck to its story.",
   "mos": 4.518
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 54.9,
   "end": 60.127,
   "file": "jane_10_s1.wav",
   "text": "Then President Nixon said it out loud: Downey involves a CIA agent.",
   "mos": 4.506
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 60.8,
   "end": 66.71,
   "file": "jane_11_s1.wav",
   "text": "Six weeks later, Downey walked across a bridge into Hong Kong, after seven thousand, four hundred and eight days.",
   "mos": 4.51
  }
 ],
